& =\left.\frac{2 x^{3 / 2}}{3 / 2}\right|_1 ^4-\left.\frac{2 x^2}{3 \times 2}\right|_1 ^4-\left.\frac{4}{3} x\right|_1 ^4
\end{aligned}

\begin{aligned}
